iction.LSTTN\'`\n**Solution**: Verify registration in `__init__.py` and run from LibCity root directory\n\n### Issue: CUDA Out of Memory\n**Symptom**: `RuntimeError: CUDA out of memory`\n**Solution**:\n- Reduce `batch_size` (try 16 or 8)\n- Use short-term only mode (`use_long_term: false`)\n- Reduce model dimensions (`transformer_out_channel`, `gwnet_end_channels`)\n\n### Issue: Adjacency Matrix Error\n**Symptom**: `KeyError: \'adj_mx\'`\n**Solution**: Ensure dataset includes adjacency matrix. Check with:\n```python\ndata_feature = dataset.get_data_feature()\nprint(\'adj_mx\' in data_feature)\n```\n\n### Issue: Shape Mismatch\n**Symptom**: `RuntimeError: size mismatch`\n**Solution**: Verify `input_window` matches data loader configuration\n\n---\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe LSTTN model has been successfully migrated to LibCity with full functionality preserved. The model:\n\n✅ **Loads and initializes correctly**\n✅ **Processes data without errors**\n✅ **Trains successfully on GPU**\n✅ **Produces reasonable predictions**\n✅ **Has all components properly registered**\n✅ **Follows LibCity conventions**\n✅ **Includes comprehensive documentation**\n\n**Status**: **PRODUCTION READY**\n\nThe model is ready for immediate use in traffic speed prediction tasks and can be further optimized with extended training and hyperparameter tuning.\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n1. **Original Paper**: LSTTN: A Long-Short Term Transformer-based Spatio-temporal Neural Network for Traffic Flow Forecasting, Knowledge-Based Systems, 2024\n2. **Repository**: https://github.com/GeoX-Lab/LSTTN\n3. **LibCity Framework**: https://github.com/LibCity/Bigscity-LibCity\n4. **LibCity Documentation**: https://bigscity-libcity-docs.readthedocs.io/\n\n---\n\n**Migration Coordinator**: Lead Migration Coordinator\n**Migration Date**: 2026-01-22\n**LibCity Version**: 2.0\n**Total Migration Time**: ~2 hours (across 4 phases)\n'}
